+/**
+ * Embedded inside Clyra's Design tab, this button hands the current project
+ * back to the host: Clyra opens the project folder in its Code workspace,
+ * starts its preview, and the conversation continues in Clyra chat.
+ *
+ * The handoff travels over postMessage because the embedded product runs on
+ * its own origin (the local OpenDesign daemon); the Clyra shell listens for
+ * `clyra:send-to-code` and performs the import.
+ *
+ * `variant="inline"` renders the compact header action that replaces the
+ * editor handoff button in the artifact chrome; the default variant is the
